{"pin":"BH02299","subcodes":[{"code":"BH02299","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou who art gazing upon My Visage and art present before this Throne! Praise be to the Lord that in His path, virtuous and sanctified deeds have been manifested. In the land of ‘Ayn and Shín","first_line_orig":"یا ایها الناظر الی الوجه و الحاضر لدی العرش لله الحمد در سبیل الهی اعمال طیبه  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"390","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15716.030.02","source":"BLIB_Or15716","locator":"030.02"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA30:098ax","source":"INBA30","locator":"098ax","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v030/?page=53"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA65:055ax","source":"INBA65","locator":"055ax","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v065/?page=57"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH1.025","source":"ADH1","locator":"025","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_1.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AHM.346","source":"AHM","locator":"346","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AHM/ahm-346.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_133BE #18 p.610","source":"AKHA_133BE #18 p.610","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQMJ1.161ax","source":"AQMJ1","locator":"161ax","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MMQ1/mmq1-163.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"PZHN v1#2 p.006","source":"PZHN v1#2 p.006","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200219220745/http://www.pazhuheshnameh.org/fa/issue2"},{"kind":"publication","code":"RAHA.070-071x","source":"RAHA","locator":"070-071x","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2021/02/raha.pdf#page=74"},{"kind":"publication","code":"TABN.247","source":"TABN","locator":"247","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/627.pdf#page=247"},{"kind":"translation","code":"RIDA.013-014x","source":"RIDA","locator":"013-014x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/rabbani_reminiscences_khalil_shahidi#page=13"}]},{"code":"BH02299THI","anchor":"